    contents: "# Copyright (c) 2026 [SELLER]. All rights reserved.\n# Licensed to a single purchaser under the terms in LICENSE.md.\n# Redistribution or resale of this source, in whole or in part, is not permitted.\n#\n# Run Gate as the same user, on the same machine, as Meridian Host — Gate\n# is meant to sit between Host's container and the network, not on a\n# separate box.\n#\n# Install:\n#   sed -i \"s|REPLACE_WITH_PACKAGE_PATH|$(pwd)|g\" adapters/systemd.service\n#   mkdir -p ~/.config/systemd/user\n#   cp adapters/systemd.service ~/.config/systemd/user/meridian-gate.service\n#   systemctl --user enable --now meridian-gate\n\n[Unit]\nDescription=Meridian Gate\nAfter=network.target\n\n[Service]\nType=simple\nWorkingDirectory=REPLACE_WITH_PACKAGE_PATH\nExecStart=/usr/bin/env node REPLACE_WITH_PACKAGE_PATH/bin/gate.mjs start\nRestart=on-failure\nRestartSec=5\n\n[Install]\nWantedBy=default.target\n",
